{"id": "cruz", "titulo": "Nicky Cruz · From the gang to Jesus", "inicio": "n1", "revelar": true, "escenas": [{"id": "n1", "titulo": "Las Piedras, Puerto Rico", "fondo": "img/fondos/cruz/las_piedras.webp", "colorFondo": "#20160c", "elementos": [{"id": "e001", "tipo": "imagen", "src": "img/personajes/nicky_nino/nicky_nino.webp", "personaje": true, "nombre": "Nicky", "x": 523, "y": 375, "w": 394, "h": 600, "rot": 0, "espejo": false}], "guion": [{"id": "l002", "tipo": "linea", "texto": "Puerto Rico. Nicky Cruz was born in 1938 in the town of Las Piedras. His parents practiced spiritism.", "forma": "caja", "expresion": "", "quien": ""}, {"id": "l003", "tipo": "linea", "texto": "When he was 15, his parents sent him to live with his brother in New York City.", "forma": "caja", "expresion": "", "quien": ""}, {"id": "l004", "tipo": "linea", "texto": "Nobody knows me there… what will become of me?", "forma": "pensamiento", "expresion": "", "quien": "e001"}], "salida": {"modo": "una", "pregunta": "", "opciones": [{"texto": "", "destino": "n2"}, {"texto": "", "destino": null}]}, "mapa": {"x": 0, "y": 0}}, {"id": "n2", "titulo": "New York", "fondo": "img/fondos/cruz/nueva_york.webp", "colorFondo": "#20160c", "elementos": [{"id": "e005", "tipo": "imagen", "src": "img/personajes/nicky/nicky.webp", "personaje": true, "nombre": "Nicky", "x": 562, "y": 285, "w": 397, "h": 690, "rot": 0, "espejo": false}], "guion": [{"id": "l006", "tipo": "linea", "texto": "In New York, Nicky ran away and joined a street gang: the Mau Maus. Within months he was one of its leaders, and later he became its president.", "forma": "caja", "expresion": "", "quien": ""}, {"id": "l007", "tipo": "linea", "texto": "Nobody tells me what to do.", "forma": "globo", "expresion": "", "quien": "e005"}], "salida": {"modo": "una", "pregunta": "", "opciones": [{"texto": "", "destino": "n3"}, {"texto": "", "destino": null}]}, "mapa": {"x": 0, "y": 0}}, {"id": "n3", "titulo": "The preacher, 1958", "fondo": "img/fondos/cruz/nueva_york.webp", "colorFondo": "#20160c", "elementos": [{"id": "e008", "tipo": "imagen", "src": "img/personajes/nicky/nicky_enojado.webp", "personaje": true, "nombre": "Nicky", "x": 248, "y": 285, "w": 465, "h": 690, "rot": 0, "espejo": false}, {"id": "e009", "tipo": "imagen", "src": "img/personajes/wilkerson/wilkerson_firme.webp", "personaje": true, "nombre": "David Wilkerson", "x": 896, "y": 295, "w": 428, "h": 680, "rot": 0, "espejo": false}], "guion": [{"id": "l010", "tipo": "linea", "texto": "In 1958 David Wilkerson, a young pastor from Pennsylvania, came to New York. He wanted to tell the gang members about Jesus.", "forma": "caja", "expresion": "", "quien": ""}, {"id": "l011", "tipo": "linea", "texto": "Nicky, Jesus loves you.", "forma": "globo", "expresion": "", "quien": "e009"}, {"id": "l012", "tipo": "linea", "texto": "Get out of here, preacher!", "forma": "globo", "expresion": "", "quien": "e008"}, {"id": "l013", "tipo": "linea", "texto": "Nicky slapped him and threatened him.", "forma": "caja", "expresion": "", "quien": ""}, {"id": "l014", "tipo": "linea", "texto": "Even if you hurt me, Jesus still loves you. He will never stop loving you.", "forma": "globo", "expresion": "", "quien": "e009"}, {"id": "c019", "tipo": "eleccion", "pregunta": "What does David Wilkerson do?", "opciones": [{"id": "o016", "texto": "Never come back", "lineas": [{"id": "l015", "tipo": "linea", "texto": "He didn’t give up: he came back to find him.", "forma": "caja", "expresion": "", "quien": ""}], "destino": "repetir"}, {"id": "o018", "texto": "Tell him again that Jesus loves him", "lineas": [{"id": "l017", "tipo": "linea", "texto": "Wilkerson told him again. And Nicky answered the same way as the first time… but those words stayed with him.", "forma": "caja", "expresion": "", "quien": ""}], "destino": "seguir"}]}], "salida": {"modo": "una", "pregunta": "", "opciones": [{"texto": "", "destino": "n4"}, {"texto": "", "destino": null}]}, "mapa": {"x": 0, "y": 0}}, {"id": "n4", "titulo": "The meeting", "fondo": "img/fondos/cruz/arena_boxeo.webp", "colorFondo": "#20160c", "elementos": [{"id": "e020", "tipo": "imagen", "src": "img/personajes/nicky/nicky_arrepentido.webp", "personaje": true, "nombre": "Nicky", "x": 396, "y": 455, "w": 328, "h": 520, "rot": 0, "espejo": false}, {"id": "e021", "tipo": "imagen", "src": "img/personajes/wilkerson/wilkerson.webp", "personaje": true, "nombre": "David Wilkerson", "x": 886, "y": 295, "w": 448, "h": 680, "rot": 0, "espejo": false}], "guion": [{"id": "l022", "tipo": "linea", "texto": "Wilkerson held a meeting in a boxing arena. Nicky went with the boys from his gang.", "forma": "caja", "expresion": "", "quien": ""}, {"id": "l023", "tipo": "linea", "texto": "As he listened, Nicky felt guilty for all the wrong he had done.", "forma": "caja", "expresion": "", "quien": ""}, {"id": "c028", "tipo": "eleccion", "pregunta": "What does Nicky do?", "opciones": [{"id": "o025", "texto": "Make fun of it and leave", "lineas": [{"id": "l024", "tipo": "linea", "texto": "That’s what he used to do… but this time he stayed.", "forma": "caja", "expresion": "", "quien": ""}], "destino": "repetir"}, {"id": "o027", "texto": "Ask God for forgiveness", "lineas": [{"id": "l026", "tipo": "linea", "texto": "God, forgive me.", "forma": "globo", "expresion": "", "quien": "e020"}], "destino": "seguir"}]}, {"id": "l029", "tipo": "linea", "texto": "When Wilkerson gave the invitation to come forward, Nicky asked God to forgive him.", "forma": "caja", "expresion": "", "quien": ""}, {"id": "l030", "tipo": "linea", "texto": "“But God proves His love for us in this: While we were still sinners, Christ died for us.” (Romans 5:8 · BSB)", "forma": "caja", "expresion": "", "quien": ""}], "salida": {"modo": "una", "pregunta": "", "opciones": [{"texto": "", "destino": "n5"}, {"texto": "", "destino": null}]}, "mapa": {"x": 0, "y": 0}}, {"id": "n5", "titulo": "A new life", "fondo": "img/fondos/cruz/comisaria.webp", "colorFondo": "#20160c", "elementos": [{"id": "e031", "tipo": "imagen", "src": "img/personajes/nicky/nicky_feliz.webp", "personaje": true, "nombre": "Nicky", "x": 547, "y": 285, "w": 426, "h": 690, "rot": 0, "espejo": false}], "guion": [{"id": "l032", "tipo": "linea", "texto": "The boys who believed in Jesus handed their weapons over to the police.", "forma": "caja", "expresion": "", "quien": ""}, {"id": "l033", "tipo": "linea", "texto": "Nicky studied the Bible and went back to the streets to preach. Many from his old gang believed too, among them his friend Israel Narvaez.", "forma": "caja", "expresion": "", "quien": ""}, {"id": "l034", "tipo": "linea", "texto": "Jesus changed me. He can change you too!", "forma": "globo", "expresion": "", "quien": "e031"}, {"id": "l035", "tipo": "linea", "texto": "“Therefore if anyone is in Christ, he is a new creation. The old has passed away. Behold, the new has come!” (2 Corinthians 5:17 · BSB)", "forma": "caja", "expresion": "", "quien": ""}], "salida": {"modo": "una", "pregunta": "", "opciones": [{"texto": "", "destino": "n6"}, {"texto": "", "destino": null}]}, "mapa": {"x": 0, "y": 0}}, {"id": "n6", "titulo": "To this day", "fondo": "img/fondos/cruz/auditorio_juvenil.webp", "colorFondo": "#20160c", "elementos": [{"id": "e036", "tipo": "imagen", "src": "img/personajes/nicky_predicador/nicky_predicador.webp", "personaje": true, "nombre": "Nicky", "x": 536, "y": 275, "w": 449, "h": 700, "rot": 0, "espejo": false}], "guion": [{"id": "l037", "tipo": "linea", "texto": "Nicky directed Teen Challenge, the center David Wilkerson founded in 1958 to help troubled young people. Later he founded his own ministry.", "forma": "caja", "expresion": "", "quien": ""}, {"id": "l038", "tipo": "linea", "texto": "His story was told in the book “Run Baby Run” (1968) and in the film “The Cross and the Switchblade” (1970).", "forma": "caja", "expresion": "", "quien": ""}, {"id": "l039", "tipo": "linea", "texto": "God didn’t give up on me. He won’t give up on you either.", "forma": "globo", "expresion": "", "quien": "e036"}], "salida": {"modo": "fin", "pregunta": "", "opciones": [{"texto": "", "destino": null}, {"texto": "", "destino": null}]}, "mapa": {"x": 0, "y": 0}}]}